{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 8,
    "「少女」": 28,
    "派蒙": 18
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7606101",
      "subQuestName": "(test)(test)废弃$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520101": {
            "id": "760520101",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520102"
            ]
          },
          "760520102": {
            "id": "760520102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哥伦比娅，你还好吗？看上去有点没精打采呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520103"
            ]
          },
          "760520103": {
            "id": "760520103",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "是你们啊。我没事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520104"
            ]
          },
          "760520104": {
            "id": "760520104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（是又在思考关于「月亮」的问题了吗…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520105"
            ]
          },
          "760520105": {
            "id": "760520105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有什么能为你做的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520106"
            ]
          },
          "760520106": {
            "id": "760520106",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520107"
            ]
          },
          "760520107": {
            "id": "760520107",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520108"
            ]
          },
          "760520108": {
            "id": "760520108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没关系，就算只是些小烦恼，说出来也会好些哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520109"
            ]
          },
          "760520109": {
            "id": "760520109",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我有点…想喝酒馆里的饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520110"
            ]
          },
          "760520110": {
            "id": "760520110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520111"
            ]
          },
          "760520111": {
            "id": "760520111",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…唔。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520112"
            ]
          },
          "760520112": {
            "id": "760520112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "抱歉！刚才我有点惊讶。因为你很少会提你自己想要什么东西嘛…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520113"
            ]
          },
          "760520113": {
            "id": "760520113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "而且，居然只是…饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520114"
            ]
          },
          "760520114": {
            "id": "760520114",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "是觉得太简单了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520115"
            ]
          },
          "760520115": {
            "id": "760520115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可能我以为至少也得是「为我摘下月亮吧」这种级别的愿望…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520116"
            ]
          },
          "760520116": {
            "id": "760520116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，不过我似乎可以理解。现在哥伦比娅无法随心所欲地行动，去酒馆说不定和摘月亮差不多难呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520117"
            ]
          },
          "760520117": {
            "id": "760520117",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不只是现在。以前在「愚人众」的时候没人要抓我，但出门散步的时候，大家还是躲得远远的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520118"
            ]
          },
          "760520118": {
            "id": "760520118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（执行官第三席…这个名号的确会让不了解她的人害怕吧…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520119"
            ]
          },
          "760520119": {
            "id": "760520119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦？不过…我突然觉得这愿望也不是那么难！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520120"
            ]
          },
          "760520120": {
            "id": "760520120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#只要求酒馆水平的饮品的话，{NICKNAME}，你不是就会做嘛！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520121"
            ]
          },
          "760520121": {
            "id": "760520121",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…真的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520122"
            ]
          },
          "760520122": {
            "id": "760520122",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "看你那么期待的样子，我反倒要紧张起来了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520123"
            ]
          },
          "760520123": {
            "id": "760520123",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "口味上有要求吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520124"
            ]
          },
          "760520124": {
            "id": "760520124",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "口味…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520125"
            ]
          },
          "760520125": {
            "id": "760520125",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我没怎么尝试过外面的饮品，反而给不出具体的方向…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520126"
            ]
          },
          "760520126": {
            "id": "760520126",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不要太厚重的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520127"
            ]
          },
          "760520127": {
            "id": "760520127",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "厚重是什么意思？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520128"
            ]
          },
          "760520128": {
            "id": "760520128",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "像「愚人众」的大衣一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520129"
            ]
          },
          "760520129": {
            "id": "760520129",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么越比喻还越模糊了啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520132"
            ]
          },
          "760520132": {
            "id": "760520132",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "好啊。交给你定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7606102",
      "subQuestName": "(test)前往调酒$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520201": {
            "id": "760520201",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520202"
            ]
          },
          "760520202": {
            "id": "760520202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样怎么样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520203"
            ]
          },
          "760520203": {
            "id": "760520203",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "它让我回想起了非常久远的过去，那时我和「霜月之子」生活在一起…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520204"
            ]
          },
          "760520204": {
            "id": "760520204",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "他们习惯将新鲜的薄荷叶、香料和浆果干共同冲泡，制成具有混合风味的饮品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520205"
            ]
          },
          "760520205": {
            "id": "760520205",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "每次经过窗边的时候，我总会闻见小屋里飘出淡淡的草木清香…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520206"
            ]
          },
          "760520206": {
            "id": "760520206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "后来呢？你尝了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520207"
            ]
          },
          "760520207": {
            "id": "760520207",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "试过，但没喝成。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520208"
            ]
          },
          "760520208": {
            "id": "760520208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？为什么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520209"
            ]
          },
          "760520209": {
            "id": "760520209",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "「神明大人」突然说出「能尝尝你家的茶吗？」这种话之后…没人敢真的将家中的「粗茶」献上…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520210"
            ]
          },
          "760520210": {
            "id": "760520210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，也是呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520211"
            ]
          },
          "760520211": {
            "id": "760520211",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "最后到我手中，就变成了在华美包装下「献予神明」的「贡品」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520212"
            ]
          },
          "760520212": {
            "id": "760520212",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不是说它难喝。但…它少了某种我路过窗边时闻到的…温馨的味道。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520213"
            ]
          },
          "760520213": {
            "id": "760520213",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "现在可以喝个够了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520214"
            ]
          },
          "760520214": {
            "id": "760520214",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520215"
            ]
          },
          "760520215": {
            "id": "760520215",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "很美味。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520216"
            ]
          },
          "760520216": {
            "id": "760520216",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…不过，倒是很少见到加入牛奶的做法。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520217"
            ]
          },
          "760520217": {
            "id": "760520217",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "毕竟是从蒙德带来的配方嘛，他们喝茶还挺喜欢加牛奶、奶油和糖的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520218"
            ]
          },
          "760520218": {
            "id": "760520218",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "很新奇，感觉还不错。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520219"
            ]
          },
          "760520219": {
            "id": "760520219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呼，你喜欢就好！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520220"
            ]
          },
          "760520220": {
            "id": "760520220",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯，谢谢你们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760520221"
            ]
          },
          "760520221": {
            "id": "760520221",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "原来不止月光能映照往事，饮品的芳香，也能唤起深藏于过去的风景…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7606103",
      "subQuestName": "(test)喝完后评价$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760520301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760520301": {
            "id": "760520301",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "(test)调的还行吧，一般合我胃口"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}